    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Work done is ZERO when force and displacement are perpendicular to each other (θ = 90°), such as a porter carrying a load on his head walking horizontally.",
        "Frictional force depends on the nature and roughness of the contacting surfaces, but is independent of the apparent area of contact.",
        "The efficiency of any real machine is always less than 100% due to friction and energy dissipation."
      ],
      "id": "ujinw37"
    },
